                "Drivability Failure (Tumble Flaps): Worn intake manifold flaps create rough idle, poor response, and recurring fault codes that often get misdiagnosed.",
                "Progressive Timing Wear (Oil Neglect): Extended oil intervals accelerate chain tensioner, guide, and cam phaser wear.",
