                    "7G-Tronic Neglect: The high torque output of the 5.5-liter V8 makes overdue transmission service more obvious and more damaging.",
                    "General Deferred-Maintenance Stack-Up: Poor examples rarely fail from one dramatic fault alone; instead, they accumulate multiple medium-cost issues at the same time.",
