                        "details": "This area covers the back of the engine bay where transmission seepage, heat-soaked wiring, and hidden upper driveline leaks can accumulate without being obvious during a quick inspection. It is also an important zone for spotting early fluid residue, heat damage, and aging components near the bulkhead."
