                            "critical": false,
                            "details": "The heavier AMG Bi-Turbo front end loads the front suspension harder than the regular V6 and V8 versions, so control arm bushings, ball joints, and drop links wear steadily with mileage. Early symptoms usually include knocking over rough roads, vague steering response, and uneven front tyre wear."
