                                    "z": 0.22,
                                    "critical": false,
                                    "details": "The heavy front axle load of the CLS 350 wears front control arm bushings, ball joints, and anti-roll bar links faster than expected. Knocking over rough roads, vague steering feel, and uneven tyre wear are common early warning signs."
