                          "details": "The front suspension of the C257 still carries the weight and torque load of a modern AMG executive drivetrain, so control arm bushings, ball joints, and anti-roll bar links remain standard inspection points with mileage. Knocking over poor surfaces, less precise steering feel, and uneven front tyre wear usually begin here."
