                                          "details": "This zone covers the rear of the engine bay where heat-soaked wiring, upper bellhousing seepage, and transmission-related ageing can become difficult-to-trace issues. It is an important inspection area for hidden fluid residue, thermal stress, and refinement-related drivetrain complaints."
