        "details": "The center of the engine bay is the main inspection point for the OM656.929 drivetrain, including injector quality, intake contamination, charge-air system integrity, turbo-related ageing, and general upper-engine leaks or heat stress. This is the most important hotspot because many expensive modern diesel six-cylinder issues begin gradually here rather than as one dramatic failure."
