    "oilSpecification": "Approx. 8.5L 5W-30 Fully Synthetic MB 229.52 / MB 229.51 low-SAPS oil. Correct oil quality and sensible service intervals are essential because turbocharger durability, timing components, internal cleanliness, and long-term emissions stability all depend on them.",
